  "_gesturePoints": "where a gesture from a match's facts plays (facts.gestures, Narrative's plotlines): ticks after the first landing, the second landing, the wait beat and the staredown's start; look_end is counted back from the clock. A point the template does not have is skipped",
  "defaultFacts": {
    "look": "hold",
