        "p": 0.8
      },
      "staredown_pair": {
        "angle": "you",
        "p": 0.8
      }
    }
  },
  "_defaultFacts": "Validator fixture, not game data: the default facts.",
  "parts": {
    "_note": "type: entrance (it has one fall at 0 and one land at its last tick), reaction or look. ticks: how far the part moves the template on. mode: the arrival mode an entrance reports. Beat kinds: fall, land, wait (he stands waiting until the staredown), line (a voice slot: the intent only), staredown. A beat's who overrides its slot's. A slot's part is an even keyed draw over its pool, unless the slot says draw false: then it is the pool's first part. Either way a part the match's facts name (facts.look) is taken when the pool holds it.",
    "drop": {
      "type": "entrance",
      "mode": "drop",
      "ticks": 36,
      "beats": [
